# P2-6: without this the build context was 4.9GB, since every `docker build`
# uploads the whole repo root to the daemon before running a single COPY.
#
# What the images actually need is small and is listed explicitly in each
# Dockerfile: requirements.txt, shared/, that service's own directory, and for
# agent_coding only, data/vocab/ (200KB of vendored CMS releases).
#
# The rest is not just wasted bytes. data/primock57 is 3.8GB of clinical audio
# and data/aci-bench is 86MB of clinical text. Neither is COPYed by any
# Dockerfile, and neither belongs in an image layer. Keep it that way.

# Virtualenv and VCS
.venv/
.git/
.gitignore

# Clinical datasets. data/vocab is re-included below: agent_coding needs it.
data/*
!data/vocab/

# Evaluation artifacts. The .full.json siblings carry clinical text.
governance/eval_artifacts/

# Caches and build detritus
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
*.egg-info/

# Not used at runtime by any service
tests/
docs/
dashboard/
scripts/
k8s/
.github/
.claude/
*.md
docker-compose.yml
Makefile

# Local secrets. .env is gitignored but exists on disk, and a build context
# is not a place for an API key.
.env
